{"step_index":200,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T19:15:44Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough of the AutoMind AI Visual Design System implementation: typography, color tokens, spacing, radius, buttons, cards, inputs, badges, containers, loading and error states with Framer Motion.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# AutoMind AI — Visual Design System Walkthrough\n\n## Summary of Completed Design System\n\nThe visual design system for **AutoMind AI** has been created with a **cinematic, minimal, luxurious, futuristic, and dark** automotive aesthetic. The system emphasizes restraint, crisp alpha borders (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06)`), and high-contrast telemetry accents.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Design System Architecture & Components\n\n```\nfrontend/\n├── app/\n│   ├── globals.css                # Typography scale, subtle telemetry grid, range sliders, scrollbars\n│   └── page.tsx                   # Interactive Design System Kitchen Sink / Showcase\n├── components/\n│   └── ui/\n│       ├── typography.tsx         # Heading (H1-H4), Text, Eyebrow, Metric\n│       ├── button.tsx             # Framer Motion spring button (primary, luxury, crimson, etc.)\n│       ├── card.tsx               # Obsidian cards, telemetry stat cards with live status light\n│       ├── input.tsx              # Text input with icon slots and shortcut badge (⌘K)\n│       ├── select.tsx             # Precision dark dropdown select\n│       ├── slider.tsx             # Dual/single range slider with value readout\n│       ├── switch.tsx             # Tactile automotive toggle switch with spring physics\n│       ├── badge.tsx              # Status chips, LiveBadge (pulsing beacon dot), SpecTag\n│       ├── section.tsx            # Section, SectionHeader, and Grid primitives\n│       ├── container.tsx          # Fluid responsive layout container (sm to full)\n│       ├── skeleton.tsx           # CarCardSkeleton, SpecGridSkeleton, Pulse shimmers\n│       ├── spinner.tsx            # Automotive HUD / Radar spinner\n│       ├── alert.tsx              # High-contrast alert banners with dismiss/actions\n│       ├── empty-state.tsx        # Cinematic zero-result recovery component\n│       └── index.ts               # Barrel export\n├── lib/\n│   ├── constants/theme.ts         # Color palette, spacing tokens, and border radii\n│   └── motion.ts                  # Reusable Framer Motion transitions and spring configs\n└── tailwind.config.ts             # Tailwind design token extensions\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2. Implemented Capabilities Breakdown\n\n### 1. Global Typography\n- [`Heading`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/typography.tsx): High-contrast uppercase headings with cinematic tracking.\n- [`Eyebrow`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/typography.tsx): Technical telemetry tags (`01 // TYPOGRAPHY`).\n- [`Metric`](file:///C:/Users/chauh/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/automind-ai/frontend/components/ui/typography.tsx): Big telemetry readouts with units and performance deltas (e.g. `2.9s 0-60 MPH`).\n\n### 2. Color Tokens & Palette\n- **Deep Obsidian (`#06080C`)**: Main canvas background.\n- **Carbon Surface (`#0B0F17`)**: Card and panel surfaces.\n- **Cyber Cyan (`#00F0FF`)**: Interactive primary highlights, focus rings, and live indicators.\n- **Champagne Gold (`#D4AF37`)**: Luxury AI advisor highlights and certified tags.\n- **Hyper Crimson (`#FF2A54`)**: Track mode, performance metrics, and critical telemetry.\n\n### 3. Spacing & Border Radius Systems\n- **Spacing Tokens**: Micro (4px-8px), component padding (16px-24px), section layout (48px-96px).\n- **Radius Tokens**: `xs` (4px), `sm` (6px), `md` (10px), `lg` (14px), `xl` (20px), `full` (9999px).\n\n### 4. Interactive Components & Micro-Interactions\n- **Buttons**: Spring tap physics (`whileTap={{ scale: 0.97 }}`), variants (`primary`, `secondary`, `luxury`, `crimson`, `outline`, `ghost`, `glass`), loading spinner integration.\n- **Cards**: `MetricCard` with live pulsing telemetry lights, `Card` with optional Framer Motion hover elevation.\n- **Inputs & Controls**:\n  - `Input` with search icon and `⌘K` keyboard shortcut badge.\n  - `Select` dropdown with custom chevron.\n  - `Slider` with custom cyan track fill and value readout.\n  - `Switch` toggle with animated sliding notch.\n- **Badges**: Status chips, `LiveBadge` with animated ping radar dot, and `SpecTag` (e.g. `MAKE: Porsche`, `0-60: 2.9s`).\n\n### 5. Asynchronous Loading & Error Recovery\n- **Skeletons**: `CarCardSkeleton` for inventory loading and `SpecGridSkeleton` for telemetry.\n- **Spinner**: Rotating HUD radar spinner with pulsing core.\n- **Alerts & Empty States**: High-contrast alert banners (`info`, `warning`, `error`, `success`) and `EmptyState` with retry action trigger.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Verification Results\n\n| Test | Tool | Result |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **TypeScript Typecheck** | `npx tsc --noEmit` | **0 errors** |\n| **Next.js Production Build** | `npm run build` | **Compiled successfully, static routes generated** |\n","Description":"Update walkthrough artifact for visual design system","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\chauh\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\10f22c6a-7cf9-4af6-ab9e-ed172ecaddf1\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough artifact","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md"}}]}
